#: d03f8eabecce48a1acce5331581893a4 f27dd4a5371a44b9bc0fb0ed49eabfd5
msgid ""
"**GPS Glitch** : the :ref:`GPS is glitching <gps-failsafe-glitch-"
"protection>` and the vehicle is in a flight mode that requires GPS (i.e. "
"Loiter, PosHold, etc) and/or the :ref:`cylindrical fence <common-"
"ac2_simple_geofence>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"**GPS Glitch**：:ref:`GPS 信号异常 <gps-failsafe-glitch-protection>`，且飞行器处于需要 GPS"
" 的飞行模式（如 Loiter、PosHold 等），和/或已启用 :ref:`圆柱形电子围栏 <common-"
"ac2_simple_geofence>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:280
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:316
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:317
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:334
#: 07027683c0444e3aa73edf120123c11b 0e9f76cfec994c0ba2b7da661d62aa71
#: 24df01ae2ecf4c09810089feb2796372 3b44e406445f408aba0581992e68d14b
#: 94e395d1d17c47368f2f8a781be8b5c8 9928bc93d7484a48abdf0f3c9db43db6
#: b7449ca54039445e8e687d7a90e58285 ff16f2a3a46c4029bb93b655b5aef23f
msgid ""
"**Need 3D Fix** : the GPS does not have a 3D fix and the vehicle is in a "
"flight mode that requires the GPS and/or the :ref:`cylindrical fence "
"<common-ac2_simple_geofence>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"**Need 3D Fix**：GPS 未获得三维定位，且飞行器处于需要 GPS 的飞行模式，和/或已启用 :ref:`圆柱形电子围栏 <common-"
"ac2_simple_geofence>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:283
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:319
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:320
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:337
#: 0954fe71d9774f2384b1fec7ed09b2ee 3aff535caf394210ab4ddf615e80c48c
#: 5062dbab53ac4aff9e0d6f4a95b699c8 92d0579ca3de4ffda0312c8993e2aebf
#: 9562dd3d375445138245bf66659b0f3a a4ed7d331e5b471ebdfc570e969889b9
#: b31a5f3f98f54da6a424168a61e74288 b7b741d4435d4ebbb429d71889d2b5c3
msgid ""
"**Bad Velocity** : the vehicle's velocity (according to inertial navigation "
"system) is above 50cm/s.  Issues that could lead to this include the vehicle"
" actually moving or being dropped, bad accelerometer calibration, GPS "
"updating at below the expected 5hz."
msgstr ""
"**Bad Velocity**：飞行器速度（由惯性导航系统计算）超过 50cm/s。可能原因包括飞行器实际移动或被抛动、加速度计校准不良、GPS "
"更新频率低于预期的 5Hz。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:288
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:324
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:325
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:342
#: 03a299dac2e941a1bddb1a5f3367fddf 0d7295d58f4a4b64b7bade2bacd83470
#: 2b340fc69435490fafda8d73425e8ad3 5310e1e712844a8988cca427366ca795
#: 9caadcdd69bf4cbb8447a2922fb6630a aaab4e0134ae48f39b3c67c9f96e77fd
#: c865be044208450284c52f48b9d9961f d2b125ef0a874e34a0a92e80298eb907
msgid ""
"**High GPS HDOP** : the GPS's HDOP value (a measure of the position "
"accuracy) is above 2.0 and the vehicle is in a flight mode that requires GPS"
" and/or the :ref:`cylindrical fence <common-ac2_simple_geofence>` is "
"enabled. This may be resolved by simply waiting a few minutes, moving to a "
"location with a better view of the sky or checking sources of GPS "
"interference (i.e. FPV equipment) are moved further from the GPS. "
"Alternatively the check can be relaxed by increasing the "
":ref:`GPS_HDOP_GOOD<GPS_HDOP_GOOD>` parameter to 2.2 or 2.5.  Worst case the"
" pilot may disable the fence and take-off in a mode that does not require "
"the GPS (i.e. Stabilize, AltHold) and switch into Loiter after arming but "
"this is not recommended."
msgstr ""
"**High GPS HDOP**：GPS 的 HDOP 值（位置精度的衡量指标）超过 2.0，且飞行器处于需要 GPS 的飞行模式，和/或已启用 "
":ref:`圆柱形电子围栏 <common-ac2_simple_geofence>`。可以尝试等待几分钟、移至视野更开阔的地点，或将 FPV 设备等 "
"GPS 干扰源移至更远处来解决。也可以将 :ref:`GPS_HDOP_GOOD<GPS_HDOP_GOOD>` 参数增至 2.2 或 2.5 "
"来放宽限制。最坏的情况下，飞手可以禁用电子围栏并在不需要 GPS 的模式（如 Stabilize、AltHold）下解锁起飞，解锁后再切换至 "
"Loiter，但不推荐这样做。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:300
