#: f950014040b145e9969d8f494bf71494 ff1a4094e41b4f0987d91ad5b1539492
msgid ""
"**Gyro cal failed**: the gyro calibration failed to capture offsets. This is"
" most often caused by the vehicle being moved during the gyro calibration "
"(when red and blue lights are flashing) in which case unplugging the battery"
" and plugging it in again while being careful not to jostle the vehicle will"
" likely resolve the issue.  Sensors hardware failures (i.e. spikes) can also"
" cause this failure."
msgstr ""
"**Gyro cal "
"failed**：陀螺仪校准未能采集偏移量。最常见原因是在陀螺仪校准期间（红蓝灯闪烁时）飞行器被移动，此时拔出电池重新插入（注意不要晃动飞行器）通常可以解决问题。传感器硬件故障（如信号尖刺）也可能导致此故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:331
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:367
