msgid ""
"**Check ANGLE_MAX**: the :ref:`ANGLE_MAX<ANGLE_MAX>` parameter which "
"controls the vehicle's maximum lean angle has been set below 10 degrees "
"(i.e. 1000) or above 80 degrees (i.e. 8000)."
msgstr ""
"**Check ANGLE_MAX**：控制飞行器最大倾斜角度的 :ref:`ANGLE_MAX<ANGLE_MAX>` 参数被设置为低于 10 度（即"
" 1000）或高于 80 度（即 8000）。"

