#: 96cb402708824888833927068731d3f0 d2d4ea5115c94632b8d8d4c946430dac
msgid ""
"If a power monitor voltage is below its failsafe low or critical voltages or"
" failsafe remaining capacity low or critical set points, this check will "
"fail and indicate which set point it is below. It will also fail if these "
"set points are inverted, ie critical point is higher than low point. See "
":ref:`failsafe-battery` for Copter, :ref:`apms-failsafe-function` for Plane,"
" or :ref:`rover-failsafes` for Rover for more information on these."
msgstr ""
"如果电源监测器电压低于其失控保护低电压或临界电压，或剩余容量低于失控保护低容量或临界容量设定值，此检查将失败并提示超出的设定点。若这些设定点顺序颠倒（即临界值高于低值），也会失败。详见"
" Copter 的 :ref:`failsafe-battery`、Plane 的 :ref:`apms-failsafe-function` 或 "
"Rover 的 :ref:`rover-failsafes`。"

