#: 1654def50aaf4a27a8998ec3d0635913 1da4beedb2a04c079817dc513fe4a1ba
#: 53e411cd6bf34ac395d83d09068c1a08 677451ecf5cd43ccafa123089a202db9
msgid ""
"Disabling pre-arm safety checks is not recommended. The cause of the pre-arm"
" failure should be corrected before operation of the vehicle if at all "
"possible. If you are confident that the pre-arm check failure is not a real "
"problem, it is possible to skip a failing check."
msgstr "不建议禁用预解锁安全检查。应尽可能在操作载具之前纠正预解锁失败的原因。如果你确信预解锁检查失败并非真正的问题，可以跳过失败的检查项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:424
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:461
#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:478
#: 0f7ab8cfeff1417283e984cd103991e6 31b6fb7103f545e6b43cd664b05b0e0f
#: 84a56675521447db8c8d3110e1ea9c59 a47cbfbf07a948f9be83616b31ea9ecc
msgid ""
"Arming checks can be individually skipped by setting the "
":ref:`ARMING_SKIPCHK<ARMING_SKIPCHK>` parameter to something other than 0. "
"For example, setting to 4 skips the checks that the GPS has lock. In "
"extremely unusual circumstances, setting the parameter to -1 can be used to "
"skip all current and future pre-arm checks (though mandatory checks still "
"remain)."
msgstr ""
"通过将 :ref:`ARMING_SKIPCHK<ARMING_SKIPCHK>` 参数设置为 0 以外的值，可以单独跳过某些解锁检查。例如，设置为 4"
" 会跳过 GPS 锁定检查。在极其特殊的情况下，可以将该参数设置为 -1 来跳过当前和将来的所有预解锁检查（但强制性检查仍然保留）。"

